# Additional setup for 3 vs 3

robot robot1 robot2 robot3
kc press K call Includes/PenaltyKickFirst # Shift+Ctrl+K (penalty kicK)
kc press L call Includes/PushingFreeKickFirst # Shift+Ctrl+L (fouL)

robot robot21 robot22 robot23
kc press K call Includes/PenaltyKickSecond # Shift+Ctrl+K (penalty kicK)
kc press L call Includes/PushingFreeKickSecond # Shift+Ctrl+L (fouL)

robot all
